  "draft_py": "# Involuntary Employment: \"Gain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature.\n# It gains haste until end of turn. Create a Treasure token.\"\n# The compiler's three steps are kept (GAIN_CONTROL until end of turn, UNTAP of the target, and\n# B5b-it-gains-kw-eot's haste on the result register). \"Create a Treasure token.\" is a fourth\n# step: CREATE_TOKEN of one Treasure (the corpus' spec, M21 Gadrak; FDN Gleaming Barrier). The\n# compiled card keyword TREASURE (MTGJSON) is kept.\ntreasure = TokenSpec(\n    name='Treasure',\n    type_line='Artifact',\n    types=('Artifact',),\n    subtypes=(),\n    power=None,\n    toughness=None,\n    keywords=(Keyword.TREASURE,),\n    abilities=(\n        ActivatedAbility(\n            cost=Cost(parts=(\n                CostSacrifice(target=Selector(\n                    count=QConst(value=1),\n                    mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n                    filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n                    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n                )),\n                CostTap(),\n            )),\n            effect=A(Verb.ADD_MANA, {'amount': QConst(value=1), 'color': 'ANY', 'controller': ControllerRef.YOU}),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\nsteps = compiled[0].effect.steps\nabilities = [\n    SpellAbility(\n        kind=SpellKind.SORCERY,\n        effect=Seq(steps=(*steps, A(Verb.CREATE_TOKEN, {'count': QConst(value=1), 'tokens': treasure}))),\n    ),\n]\n",
